<title>ITALY: Monte dei paschi Siena nominates new president.</title>
<headline>Monte dei paschi Siena nominates new president.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Monte dei Paschi di Siena said on Tuesday its administrative body had nominated unanimously Luigi Spaventa as the bank's new president.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that his nomination and those of other board members would be put to the bank's assembly on Thursday.</p>
<p>Spaventa is a professor in politics and economics at Rome's La Sapienza university and a former Budget minister.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom 39 6 678 2501</p>
